      "body": "If I understand correctly is just false positive from TSAN? Can shut this up by adding `race:_PyType_AllocNoTrack` to `Tools/tsan/suppressions_free_threading.txt`. Or if you worried about potentially suppressing too much then minimally invasive code that fixes would be something like:\n```c\n#ifdef _Py_THREAD_SANITIZER\n    memset((void *)((char *)obj + sizeof(PyObject)), '\\0', size - sizeof(PyObject));\n#else\n    memset(obj, '\\0', size);\n#endif\n```",
      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
